{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yomojomo of Didi and Jeong Tae-woong's Life in Korea"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hello, this is Didi."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hello, this is Jeong Tae-woong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yomojomo of Life in Korea is a podcast where two people living in Korea talk about the various aspects of life in Korea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Could you introduce today's topic for us?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 22000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today's topic is something that happened recently in Korea. It's the rainy season."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The rainy season is called the season of rain that repeats every summer in Korea,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we call the period when a lot of rain falls mainly between the end of June and mid-July the rainy season."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This period changes a little bit every year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45000,
    "dDurationMs": 8000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So recently, they said the rainy season would come at the end of June, but then it didn't come, and then it came back,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and last week there was a lot of rain nationwide."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How has it been where you are, Teacher Tae-woong?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As you know, I'm in Busan, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In Busan too, they kept saying rain was coming but it didn't come,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then last week it rained really heavily for several days."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, it kept coming here too, I'm in the Gyeonggi-do area,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and today we wanted to let everyone participate,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so before we talk about the episode, I'd like to give you a quiz."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The quiz is that we're going to talk about three things,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you just need to figure out which one is correct and which ones are wrong,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and out of the three things, two are correct and one is wrong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you need to find which one is wrong and which number it is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the one wrong answer is the correct answer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, you just need to write down which one is wrong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, during the rainy season, the amount of food delivery orders increases."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Second, the rainy season is 30 days every year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Third, Korea's representative rainy day food is pajeon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right. There might be hints in our conversation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so please listen all the way through and leave your answer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we'll announce the answer in the next episode."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Please participate a lot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How did you spend the rainy season?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For me, there's not really much difference, honestly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Were you at home?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I ended up staying home even more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We all work from home,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but Teacher Tae-woong, you do exercise, don't you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Did that not affect you? Like taking walks or things like that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I couldn't take walks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But sometimes I do go out,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when it rains a lot I wear a raincoat,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a long raincoat that comes down to my legs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and when I walk alone on a deserted walking path,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it feels like a scene from a horror movie."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is the raincoat disposable?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No. I use a sturdy raincoat that I can keep using."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seems like it's good to have one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 203000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seems that way. Sometimes when it rains really hard I just give up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and don't worry about getting a little wet, and that seems nice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The raincoat I wear is also a sturdy raincoat, I think,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but under heavy rain pouring down,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 221000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when I walk for about an hour,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "water gets all over my body anyway."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I see. So it doesn't block it completely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seems that way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 231000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So did you substitute exercise by taking walks in a raincoat?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Exercise can be done at home too"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 241000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's really great"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's good to keep exercising"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Didi, do you dislike typhoons more, or the rainy season more?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 254000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Typhoons don't seem to happen much recently. Big typhoons"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 259000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I see"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't have many memories of it happening"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 263000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or it just passes quickly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the rainy season wasn't so bad because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 272000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For me, it was extremely hot, but around the rainy season"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The temperature dropped and it felt cool"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That part was okay"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And since I'm at home anyway"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't really dislike it that much. Neither the rainy season nor typhoons"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What about you, Teacher Tae-woong?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 290000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, if you don't go outside, that makes sense"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 293000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you think about it from a commuter's perspective, the rainy season seems harder"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right. And it's not just a few days either. It's for weeks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 302000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You always have to carry an umbrella with you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I forgot about it for a moment, but I have a memory of that being difficult"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 309000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right. Actually, I tend to like typhoons"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Typhoons? Why?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 315000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like I mentioned earlier, when I walk alone on a hiking trail with no one around"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I find it fun to see the thunder"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You walk around even in typhoons?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sometimes. Yes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's awesome"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can see that thunder really up close, you know"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 334000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like the loud, rumbling thunder sound"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 338000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thunder is the sound and lightning is what you see"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right. Both of those"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 343000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That thunder boom, rumble, boom boom sound right from below"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 348000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I see the lightning right next to me too"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's that kind of fun to it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 354000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You find that fun?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 356000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it is fun"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 358000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For me, it was last week, I think"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When the rainy season was really dragging on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 364000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There was a day with really intense thunder and lightning in the early morning"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 370000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was really loud and I kept getting startled"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 375000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even though thunder and lightning aren't that scary"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 378000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you hear them, you do get a bit startled"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 381000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right. You do get startled"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 385000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You've got nerves of steel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 386000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm not sure. Maybe I've played too many horror games?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 388000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's the thing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 389000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My dopamine levels"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Have gone up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 396000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think that might be it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 397000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't get startled easily anymore"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I like the rainy season less than typhoons"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Less. It's not fun and there's no thrill"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's humid"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And actually, you like bright days, right"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 411000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right. In summer, those kinds of scenes are pretty too"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 416000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you see the sunlight in a bright morning"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 419000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your energy goes up and all that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when it rains, it feels a bit depressing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But last week was the end of the rainy season"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Starting this week, it seems to be getting bright and sunny again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 434000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It feels like the beginning of midsummer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 438000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But actually, I don't know much about that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's a characteristic of the rainy season."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 443000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 446000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Actually, I mentioned before that it had disappeared."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 450000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I looked it up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 452000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's a place called the Korea Meteorological Administration that forecasts the weather, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 456000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 458000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They don't officially announce the rainy season—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 462000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The start and end of the rainy season."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 465000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 466000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When we say the rainy season has ended,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 469000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's information from the internet"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 470000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or information that came out in the news somewhere,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 475000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the actual government agency doesn't officially say anything about it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 478000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They say they can't."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 479000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 481000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's the real truth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 485000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 487000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, how would you even know that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 489000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 491000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when it rains, Teacher Tae-woong, what's difficult for you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 495000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For me, it's just—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just that breathing feels difficult, I guess?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 500000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My body feels heavy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 502000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, when it rains, of course"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 504000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "yes, it's always dark outside,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 509000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there's this kind of droopy feeling,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 512000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "oh, like no mood at all,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 514000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like I don't feel that drive to work hard or anything,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 519000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so it's not great."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 522000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It definitely seems to exist."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 523000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 524000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The sky is dark too, so I can't even open my eyes well in the morning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 527000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, that's true, that's true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 528000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 529000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I sleep more too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 532000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It gets sluggish."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 533000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 534000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have a few things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 536000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The thing I hate the most"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 538000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is no matter how much I style my hair before going out,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 541000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it all falls apart in like 30 seconds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 544000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 545000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because of the humidity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 546000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 547000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And also because of the humidity,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 549000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when I do laundry"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 551000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I dry it inside my room,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 554000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because I don't have a balcony."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 556000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It doesn't dry—the laundry never dries."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 557000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 559000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I have to keep running a circulator fan or something like that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 563000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and even then it doesn't dry well,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 566000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I end up running it a couple of times,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 568000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "things like that happen too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 570000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That would really be inconvenient in daily life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 573000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 575000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It would be nice to have at least a dryer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 577000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 578000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I really want to buy a dryer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 580000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it's expensive, you know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 581000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 582000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Actually, a dryer and a circulator are kind of essential items."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 585000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In a one-room apartment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 587000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm-hmm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 589000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then the good thing is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 591000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 592000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "People talk about that a lot, you know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 593000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like food you eat on rainy days."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 595000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 597000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Teacher Tae-woong, do you have any foods that come to mind when it rains?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 600000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 602000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Braised pork with kimchi?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 604000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 606000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What is it? It's jjamppong for me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 608000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, that's good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 610000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Jjamppong on a rainy day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 612000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's nice, right? It's the best."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 614000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On rainy days, I feel like eating some noodles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Jjamppong, jjajangmyeon, things like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 618000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 620000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what gets talked about a lot is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 622000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 624000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "things cooked in oil,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 626000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Jeon cooking?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 628000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's always"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 630000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not very satisfying, but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 632000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that kind of feeling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 634000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The feeling is definitely different."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 636000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It doesn't seem sweet like pancakes at all, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 638000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With syrup drizzled on it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 640000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 642000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I eat it dipped in soy sauce,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 644000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's a salty dish."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 646000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's salty, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 648000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Didi,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 650000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "do you prefer noodles?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 652000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or do you prefer jeon?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 654000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Um,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 656000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think I eat noodles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 658000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Honestly, I only eat jeon"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 660000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "during ancestral rites or"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 662000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "holidays, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 664000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've almost never bought it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 666000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Jeon is more of a thing you eat with alcohol rather than with rice,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 668000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at pojangmacha or"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 670000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "drinking tents, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 672000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You order it with makgeolli and jeon,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 674000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like a jeon assortment or something."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 676000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And since I don't drink much anyway,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 678000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've never"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 680000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bought it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 682000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I think I eat noodles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 684000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So then,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 686000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what if I got a romantic interest?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 688000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To my romantic interest,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 690000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "since it's a rainy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 692000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "day for us,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 694000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "should we go eat some jjamppong?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 696000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "saying it like that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 698000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or should we go eat pajeon since it's rainy?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 700000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "talking like that—which one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 702000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "do you think would"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 704000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "make my romantic interest's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 706000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "heart feel better?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 708000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Huh?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 710000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Both are fine, though?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 712000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 714000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Both are naturally"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 716000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "something to say?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 718000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Something you can understand and relate to?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 720000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 722000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you want jjamppong or pajeon?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 724000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Of course pajeon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 726000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Don't you think so?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 728000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On rainy days, it's pajeon and makgeolli."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 730000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's kind of in Korea, kind of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 732000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 734000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Doesn't it become kind of official? Or not?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 736000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is kind of official."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 738000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But noodles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 740000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Noodles seem kind of official too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 742000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It feels like everyone shares that feeling?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 744000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On rainy days it's flour."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 746000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 750000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or not? It could be different for each person."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 752000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, both are flour anyway."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 754000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 756000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On rainy days, alcohol and flour"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 758000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are craved."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 760000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's a saying that you want to eat them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 762000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I wonder why."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 764000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I looked it up a bit,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 766000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and when you eat flour,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 768000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it apparently relieves sadness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 770000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Huh? Is that really true?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 772000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's carbohydrates,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 774000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and things like vitamin B"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 776000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are contained in it, so it can help"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 778000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with relieving sadness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 780000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh."
    } ]
  }, {
