    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Jeong Tae-woong teaches Korean to Korean language learners through games."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 952000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have 10 umbrellas at home."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 960000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I often wear slippers during the rainy season."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 978000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't run on rainy days."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 991000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have rain boots."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 999000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've rolled down the stairs on a rainy day before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1010000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've been camping on a rainy day before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1020000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't run on rainy days."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1025000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't exercise on rainy days."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1037000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I take walks on rainy days."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1054000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're talking about me as a person, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1060000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's make it recent times."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1064000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Teacher Tae-woong, do you have a question?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1071000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I feel like you'd definitely have rain boots."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1074000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1076000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because a lot of people have rain boots."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1081000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Rain boots."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1084000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Rain boots were trendy too, weren't they?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1087000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I feel like you'd definitely have them. So it might be a trick too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1093000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I didn't think you'd definitely have them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1096000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you have rain boots?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1098000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't have them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1100000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't have a lot of other things too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1103000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, slippers?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1106000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's a question about the problem, so."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1112000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You don't have slippers because you wear them?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1115000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's about the problem, so I can't say."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1118000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Please don't ask leading questions like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1122000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then how am I supposed to guess?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1125000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, we've talked about a lot of things so far, you know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1128000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "10 umbrellas at home? That's too hard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1133000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You didn't actually count them, did you? Just for this problem today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1137000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You went over to the umbrella stand there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1140000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One, two, three, four. Did I count that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1143000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Counting might not be that difficult."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1147000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's talk about it one by one. A story."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1150000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, if you tell a story, of course it's a story about that, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1154000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we're detecting whether you're lying or not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1157000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You want me to tell a fake story?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1160000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Making up a fake story. That's how we'll be able to guess it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1168000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Got it. I'll give it a try."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1171000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What about the first sentence? Keep it short."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1176000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I live near a tourist area."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1183000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there are just a lot of people coming and going. In our neighborhood."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1189000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "People who don't live here but just pass through."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1192000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And near my house there's a famous walking trail."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1197000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there are a lot of tourists."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1200000,
    "dDurationMs": 6680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sometimes when it rains, customers buy umbrellas at convenience stores and then"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1206680,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just leave the umbrellas on the street."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1210360,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, perfectly fine umbrellas."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1211960,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1212960,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1213960,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I can just take those umbrellas home with me, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1219400,
    "dDurationMs": 1159,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Picking up umbrellas."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1220559,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1221559,
    "dDurationMs": 1561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I pick them up and bring them home."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1223120,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1224200,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's how I've accumulated nine of them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1226080,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1227600,
    "dDurationMs": 2199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1229799,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1230799,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second one is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1231799,
    "dDurationMs": 11881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second one is, when my socks get wet,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1243680,
    "dDurationMs": 1079,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "oh, it really bothers me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1244759,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1246959,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, and I also really hate it when my pants get wet,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1252599,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1253599,
    "dDurationMs": 4081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I wear shorts pretty often."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1257680,
    "dDurationMs": 5919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, you wear them. Okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1263599,
    "dDurationMs": 1881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, I wear shorts frequently."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1265480,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1266480,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1267480,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Running—I don't do that, so how about a story once, well"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1272480,
    "dDurationMs": 6159,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't run."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1278639,
    "dDurationMs": 3721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even on days when it's not raining, I don't run."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1283360,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I just don't run, basically."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1286120,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, I don't run these days."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1291400,
    "dDurationMs": 3839,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On rainy days, hey, and I just don't run."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1295239,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1296239,
    "dDurationMs": 3881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, it all sounds plausible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1300120,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1301120,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you must have nine umbrellas then."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1303760,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It all sounds pretty plausible, somehow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1308800,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'll think about it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1309800,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1311800,
    "dDurationMs": 5399,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For me, first, I didn't originally have rain boots,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1317199,
    "dDurationMs": 2921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and my birthday is in June,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1320120,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1321120,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so this year I received a gift."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1324720,
    "dDurationMs": 2159,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Rain boots that I wanted to have."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1326879,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh wow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1327879,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I got boots."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1329919,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1330919,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the second one is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1331919,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1332919,
    "dDurationMs": 5961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I was little, I went to an art academy when I was really young,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1339039,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and when I was coming home from there, I came down the stairs really fast,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1343279,
    "dDurationMs": 2521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and those stairs are slippery, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1345800,
    "dDurationMs": 3839,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I was wearing rain boots back then too, when I was little,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1349639,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they were so slippery that I tumbled down and got really badly hurt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1354479,
    "dDurationMs": 2121,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, that's detailed though."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1356600,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Uh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1357600,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the third one is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1360600,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Camping—when I was little, I went to that pretty often too,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1363320,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not that often, but I went sometimes with my family,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1367360,
    "dDurationMs": 5559,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "usually Dad's vacation falls during the rainy season a lot,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1372919,
    "dDurationMs": 3601,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so the timing overlapped a lot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1376520,
    "dDurationMs": 4399,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I went camping, and it rained so heavily at night"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1380919,
    "dDurationMs": 3681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that my back got completely soaked."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1384600,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've experienced camping on a rainy day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1387320,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1388320,
    "dDurationMs": 3319,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh right, that's how this game works originally."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1391639,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seems like it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1392639,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's how you're supposed to make a guess, it seems."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1394399,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, but there's a lie mixed in among these."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1396399,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's what I mean."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1397399,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1398399,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1399399,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Should we pick one?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1400399,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Since I haven't done this in years,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1402759,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But you can also ask a question here, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1406119,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1407119,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1408119,
    "dDurationMs": 5881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when I went camping with my family,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1414000,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it was before we moved to Gyeonggi Province."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1415600,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, back then."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1417960,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, so your older brother went too?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1422240,
    "dDurationMs": 1439,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right, four of us."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1423679,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1424679,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I didn't catch a cold."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1426199,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seems like I didn't catch a cold."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1428199,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because I was young."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1429199,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pretty sturdy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1430199,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because I was little."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1431199,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because I was little, because I was little."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1432199,
    "dDurationMs": 3961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1436160,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I fell down the stairs on a rainy day and went to the hospital."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1442160,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My mother raised me to be quite tough."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1444800,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1445800,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I just had a lot of bruises on my legs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1451240,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I rested at home."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1452240,
    "dDurationMs": 6680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How old were you then?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1458920,
    "dDurationMs": 3319,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was very young, five or six years old."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1462239,
    "dDurationMs": 11201,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A five-year-old fell down the stairs, didn't even go to the hospital, and nothing was broken."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1473440,
    "dDurationMs": 1639,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's how they raised me back then."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1475079,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hmm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1482079,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have a question, should I ask?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1483519,
    "dDurationMs": 2681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Please, ask anytime if you have a question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1486200,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So today I counted the umbrellas a bit when I went there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1489760,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, you counted them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1490760,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I counted them to see how many had accumulated."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1494760,
    "dDurationMs": 1319,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, of course."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1496079,
    "dDurationMs": 1801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But exactly ten had fallen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1497880,
    "dDurationMs": 1239,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1499119,
    "dDurationMs": 2801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You must have felt really good, exactly ten falling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1501920,
    "dDurationMs": 9080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, like one of three problems happened, and I felt good about it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1511000,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's this debate in Korea, you know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1513160,
    "dDurationMs": 7320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whether you wear slippers on rainy days or wear socks and sneakers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1520480,
    "dDurationMs": 2879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I didn't even know there was such a debate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1523359,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh really."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1524359,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1525359,
    "dDurationMs": 2121,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It might just be something my friends around me talk about."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1527480,
    "dDurationMs": 8879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh but wearing socks and sneakers is just the same, just what you normally"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1536359,
    "dDurationMs": 1681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wear anyway."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1538040,
    "dDurationMs": 3079,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, it means you do it as usual."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1541119,
    "dDurationMs": 1921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the choice there is this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1543040,
    "dDurationMs": 3519,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I just walk around whether water gets in or not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1546559,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm going to get wet anyway."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1547559,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1548559,
    "dDurationMs": 4641,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it the type where you're careful and wear sneakers to keep water out as much as possible,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1553200,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or is it the ocean where you just go for it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1554880,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1555880,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1556880,
    "dDurationMs": 2679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Teacher Tae-woong just stomps right through it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1559559,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm going to get wet anyway."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1562559,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1563559,
    "dDurationMs": 3361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My pants are going to get wet, so I just stomp through."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1566920,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Splash."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1567920,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1568920,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1569920,
    "dDurationMs": 3479,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why can't you answer?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1573399,
    "dDurationMs": 4481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wait, wait—I said I dislike it earlier, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1577880,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This sentence is a bit odd here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1580359,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I said I dislike it earlier."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1583359,
    "dDurationMs": 2561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You said you dislike getting your pants wet, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1585920,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, I dislike getting my pants wet. I dislike getting my pants wet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1589480,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pants just cling to your legs, you know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1591640,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1593640,
    "dDurationMs": 5039,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I also dislike getting my socks wet, so I just go barefoot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1598679,
    "dDurationMs": 2521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now that I think about it, it doesn't seem so bad."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1601200,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What? What? What's happening now?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1604720,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The problem doesn't change."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1609720,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now that I think about it, what—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1613160,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if I have to run anyway,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1617000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1618000,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have no choice but to wear socks, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1619600,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1620600,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1622600,
    "dDurationMs": 4759,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But since you wear them often, you could wear them when exercising too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1627359,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1628359,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That could be the case."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1629359,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1630359,
    "dDurationMs": 1801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's pick one thing we're sure about then."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1632160,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I understand by this point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1634480,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For me, something certain—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1637160,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think you probably don't run on rainy days."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1640760,
    "dDurationMs": 2519,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1643279,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, yes, yes, yes, yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1647679,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Confirmed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1648679,
    "dDurationMs": 1961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But as a side note,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1650640,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1651640,
    "dDurationMs": 7319,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I did that 366-day running challenge last year—you know, running every single day for a year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1658959,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm-hmm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1659959,
    "dDurationMs": 4961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then around July or August I caught COVID and didn't run,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1664920,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1665920,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but up until then I ran no matter what, even when it rained."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1670200,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm-hmm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1671200,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1672200,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1673200,
    "dDurationMs": 3639,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But these days, when it rains, I don't run."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1676839,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Huh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1677839,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1678839,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1679839,
    "dDurationMs": 5560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I've fallen down the stairs on a rainy day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1685399,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is that true?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1687119,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1688119,
    "dDurationMs": 1801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah yes, the story had so much detail."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1689920,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, that's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1690920,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1691920,
    "dDurationMs": 2879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, it wasn't that serious of an injury."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1694799,
    "dDurationMs": 1401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think that's why I didn't go to the hospital."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1696200,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1697200,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1698200,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I got a big bruise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1699600,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1700600,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That happened."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1701600,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1702600,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So everyone, please be careful not to fall on those stairs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1707640,
    "dDurationMs": 3319,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You really have to be careful—you can't rush down the stairs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1710959,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1711959,
    "dDurationMs": 5001,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No matter how much of a hurry you're in, you must always hold the handrail when coming down the stairs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1716960,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1717960,
    "dDurationMs": 3279,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So now we have 2 left."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1721239,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1724119,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Should we pick one, or what?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1726159,
    "dDurationMs": 2241,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Um, do you have any questions?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1728400,
    "dDurationMs": 4759,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think you probably wear slippers pretty often."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1733159,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1734159,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1735159,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, but you see—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1736159,
    "dDurationMs": 8801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because I think you really hate getting your socks wet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1744960,
    "dDurationMs": 4199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's probably why you didn't run either."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1749159,
    "dDurationMs": 2481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, so that's the reason you don't run."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1751640,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1752640,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1754640,
    "dDurationMs": 3719,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Um, could I ask what kind of slippers you wear?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1758359,
    "dDurationMs": 2281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Slippers you wear when it rains."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1760640,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Jjori."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1761880,
    "dDurationMs": 2279,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, I don't wear jjori."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1764159,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1765159,
    "dDurationMs": 8121,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Jjori is a slipper where you put it between your big toe and your second toe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1773280,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1774280,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1775280,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's what we call jjori."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1776280,
    "dDurationMs": 1199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I don't wear jjori."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1777479,
    "dDurationMs": 1841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, so just regular three-stripe slippers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1779320,
    "dDurationMs": 2719,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That kind of style of slipper."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1782039,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, the typical kind of slipper."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1784359,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1785359,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1786359,
    "dDurationMs": 4521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know how water gets into slippers when it rains."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1790880,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It gets all squishy and wet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1793880,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1794880,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Doesn't that happen to you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1795880,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It does."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1796880,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's fine though."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1797880,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But sneakers are the same way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1800880,
    "dDurationMs": 1799,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Don't all shoes do that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1802679,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1803679,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1805000,
    "dDurationMs": 9000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I wear slippers and step in a puddle and get mud water on my feet like this, that's okay?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1815000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then clean water falls from the sky"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1819000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it washes it again?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1824000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Transparent water falls from the sky so it's okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1831000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then I also have a question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1837000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Did you go camping often with your family when you were young?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1842000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not often, but maybe like three or four times?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1846000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "3, 4 times? We didn't go that often."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1850000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We weren't really enthusiasts about it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1854000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not enthusiasts?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1856000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the summer, we'd think, what should we do this time? Let's go to a valley."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1861000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're not an enthusiast, but did you have a tent?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1864000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We did."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1866000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Was it a big tent that a family of four could use?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1869000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, we had one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1877000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's difficult."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1878000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But you said rain got inside?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1880000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Rain got inside. Old tents weren't that good back then."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1885000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you happen to remember the brand of the tent from back then?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1889000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't know, I don't know. I was an I."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1892000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you happen to remember the color of the tent?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1894000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was purple."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1896000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Purple?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1898000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It had purple mixed in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1900000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like black and purple mixed together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1904000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you remember what rice dish you ate when you went camping?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1911000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We made things like spicy fish stew."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1913000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We caught fish in the valley."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1917000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we grilled things like pork belly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1920000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We also ate ramen, just that kind of feeling?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1925000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Are those rubber boots expensive ones?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1930000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because I received them as a gift."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1933000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're not over 100,000 won. Probably."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1937000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is the person who gave you that gift someone very close to you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1945000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right. My closest friend."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1950000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What month is that friend's birthday?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1953000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's two days different from mine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1956000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we exchange gifts every year. With my older sister."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1961000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Older sister?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1962000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's not easy?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1964000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How do you choose 10..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1968000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Should we try guessing?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1969000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's try guessing once."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1972000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My guess is that you wear slippers often."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1978000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, I understand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1981000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My guess is that on rainy days you wear slippers often."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1988000,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My guess is that you've never gone camping on a rainy day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1996000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the truth is you have rain boots?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2003000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The answer is I don't have rain boots."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2012000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What about you, Teacher Tae-woong?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2014000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have 10 umbrellas at home."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2019000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Exactly 10 umbrellas?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2021000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And during the rainy season I absolutely don't wear slippers. I wear sandals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2029000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Barefoot?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2031000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. I wear sandals barefoot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2038000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You've really gone camping before?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2041000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On a rainy day?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2043000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2046000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I didn't know it would rain, but it seems like it came at night."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2051000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Anyway, it rained all night and I have a memory of my back getting damp."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2056000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you only went 3, 4 times and didn't go after that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2059000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I guess so. It seems like my mom didn't like it very much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2062000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2065000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You were both wrong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2066000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It doesn't make sense, things like spicy fish stew."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2069000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was all true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2071000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Anyway, I have 10 umbrellas, so if you want to see them, just let me know and I'll take them out for you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2078000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's fine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2081000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I counted them, there were exactly 10?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2082000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2085000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is there an umbrella you reach for often among them?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2088000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2090000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Should I just show you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2092000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Bring them out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2093000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most of them are convenience store umbrellas. Really. Like I said."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2097000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I should capture this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2098000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just a moment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2100000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm looking."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2102000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You brought all of them, right? It's 10, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2104000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It looks like 8."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2106000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can you see here?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2108000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just here alone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2109000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's so many."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2110000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "1, 2, 3, 4, 5."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2116000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "9 umbrellas."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2118000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And one more here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2120000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's 10."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2122000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're an umbrella millionaire."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2124000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2126000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And among these, there's also a YouTube umbrella."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2131000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "YouTube. Back then."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2134000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I got it at a YouTube event back then."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2137000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's pretty."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2139000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it's not practical."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2142000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Anyway, so there were 10 umbrellas like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2144000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The umbrella you reach for often is?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2146000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That one is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2147000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That one is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2150000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The thinnest and most slender umbrella among the convenience store umbrellas."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2157000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "An ultra-fine fiber umbrella."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2158000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. It's incredibly light."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2162000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's practical."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2163000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2165000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you. Umbrella haul."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2173000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's too bad. You both got it wrong. You're good at lying."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2176000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2177000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You both lie well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2179000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This slipper was the trick. Actually."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2181000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right. I mean, you're barefoot anyway, but you wear sandals instead of slippers?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2187000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why not slippers? They could float away?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2191000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. They can slip off, you know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2193000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right. That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2195000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And those slippers look pretty nice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2201000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Slippers you treasure?"
